        {
          "text": "Pele Sihoni takwakazumizya ba-Israyeli kwiinda akati kacisi cakwe pe. Sihoni wakabunganya bantu bakwe boonse, weza kuzoocinga ba-Israyeli munkanda. Asike ku-Jahazi, wakalwana aba-Israyeli. ",
