        {
          "text": "Nkabela ba-Israyeli bakamuzunda amulomo wapanga, aboobo bakatola nyika yakwe kuzwa ku-Arinoni kusikila ku-Jaboki kumugaano wabana ba-Amoni, nkaambo Jazeri ngomugaano wabana ba-Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
