        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ba-Israyeli bakatola minzi eyi yoonse, nkabela ba-Israyeli bakakala muminzi yoonse yaba-Amori, mu-Hesiboni amutunzuunzi twawo toonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
