              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Hesiboni kauli munzi wa-Sihoni mwami waba-Amori; nkaambo kalwanide amwami mutaanzi waba-Moabu akumunyanzya nyika yakwe yoonse kusikila ku-Arinoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
